Lets skate-host report the trick line in progress (trick name, sequence and
line scores, multiplier, line timer) so the addon can draw a score HUD, and
lets the host set the skater's natural stance (regular or goofy) the way
Skate 3's profile does. Applied on top of chasmlol/2010-rust-rewrite-mashup at
f608f85 by native/patch-engine.sh until the change lands upstream. Same
license as the files it changes (Apache-2.0).

